---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import me from '../assets/me.jpg';
---

<Base
  title="About – Motha Maker"
  description="Meet Marie Neal, the artist behind Motha & Maker — a digital artist based in the UK, creating hand-drawn illustrations one careful line at a time. No AI generators, no shortcuts."
>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'ProfilePage',
    mainEntity: {
      '@type': 'Person',
      '@id': 'https://mothamaker.com/#artist',
      name: 'Marie Neal',
      jobTitle: 'Digital Artist',
      description: 'Digital artist based in the UK, creating hand-drawn illustrations one careful line at a time.',
      nationality: 'GB',
      sameAs: [
        'https://www.instagram.com/mothaandmaker',
        'https://www.youtube.com/@mariewatson3371',
        'https://www.facebook.com/people/Motha-Maker/61579338660267',
      ],
    },
  })} />
  <section class="about-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-inner">
        <div class="about-image-wrap gloss">
          <Image src={me} alt="Marie Neal" width={800} quality={82} format="webp" loading="eager" />
        </div>

        <div class="about-text">
          <h1>About Me</h1>
          <span class="about-subtitle">The artist behind Motha &amp; Maker</span>
          <div class="about-rule"></div>

          <p>Welcome. I'm Marie — a digital artist based in the UK, creating hand-drawn illustrations one careful line at a time. No AI generators, no shortcuts. Just a stylus, a screen, and a lot of patience.</p>

          <p>My work spans food and drink illustration, wildlife and nature, and most recently a series dedicated to the 2026 Winter Olympics — capturing the speed, grace, and raw determination of the athletes competing on the world stage.</p>

          <p>Every piece starts with the same thing: a genuine love of drawing. That instinct to look closely at the world and find the visual story worth telling. I hope you find something here that resonates.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
